dem-long-list.gls -- dem-long-list.scm

The file: (define before-list 1), then (define big-list (quote ( ... )))
whose list has 100,000 lines of (item NNNNNN "ção € 😀" #\x 3.14 (nested
(deeper N))), then (define after-list 2).  6.8 MB, well closed.

Open:   chezweb dem-long-list.scm

1. C-n  C-M-f            from the start of line 2
   Expect: the cursor after ")))" at the end of big-list, within 2 s.
2. C-M-b                 Expect: back at the start of line 2, within 2 s.
3. M-g 50003 RET  C-M-f
                         Expect: the cursor after that (item ...), at once.
4. C-M-u                 Expect: the cursor on the ( that opens the list
                         of items (line 3), within 2 s.
5. C-M-SPC               mark-sexp, then M-w
                         Expect: "Copied ..." (6.8 MB), within 2 s.
6. M->  C-y              Expect: 6.8 MB yanked at the end, within 2 s.
7. C-/                   Expect: the yank undone, within 2 s.
8. M-x indent-region on a small region only (C-SPC, C-n C-n C-n, C-M-\)
                         Expect: the three lines indented, at once.
9. C-x k RET, then "y": do not save.
